## 🎯 План исправления (DIY)

### 1. Dark Mode (30 мин)
```css
:root {
  --bg: #f8f7f4; --text: #1a1a1a; --surface: #fff;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root { --bg: #121212; --text: #e4e4e7; --surface: #1e1e1e; }
}
```

### 2. Glassmorphism cards (15 мин)
```css
.service-group, .review-card, .ba-card {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
  border-radius: 16px;
}
```

### 3. Fluid typography (10 мин)
```css
h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem); }
h2 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); }
p { font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.125rem); }
```

### 4. Container queries (15 мин)
```css
.services-grid { container-type: inline-size; }
@container (min-width: 400px) { .service-group { flex-direction: row; } }
```

### 5. Focus states + micro-animations (10 мин)
```css
:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary); outline-offset: 2px; }
.btn, .card, a { transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1); }
.btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
.card:hover { box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.12); }
```

